{"id":"entdeckung","lemma":"Entdeckung","pos":"noun","rank":3918,"glosses":["discovery"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/60/De-Entdeckung.ogg/De-Entdeckung.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Entdeckung","plural":"Entdeckungen"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich habe eine Entdeckung gemacht.","en":"I've made a discovery.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to make","l":"machen"}]},{"text":"Die Entdeckung hat mich überrascht.","en":"I was surprised at the discovery.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"surprised"}]},{"text":"Diese Entdeckung war völlig zufällig.","en":"That discovery was quite accidental.","words":[{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null,{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"completely"},{"g":"accidentally"}]},{"text":"Es war eine der großen Entdeckungen in der Wissenschaft.","en":"It was one of the great discoveries in science.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"big","l":"groß"},null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"science"}]},{"text":"Er machte eine sehr wertvolle Entdeckung.","en":"He made a very valuable discovery.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"valuable","l":"wertvoll"},null]}]}